# Real market data inputs are never committed; evidence keeps sha256 + metrics only.
data/real_input/

# V8 evidence store. The ATTEMPT LOGS, receipts and manifests are committed —
# they are our own records of what was requested and what the venue answered,
# and they are what makes a blocked acquisition verifiable rather than a
# claim. The raw venue responses and the panels derived from them are NOT
# committed: whether Bybit/OKX market data may be redistributed is a licensing
# question this repository has not resolved, and the pack manifest records
# that stance as UNRESOLVED.
#
# This is not a reproducibility fig leaf. `quant-trade v8 evidence-pack`
# builds a content-addressed bundle and `evidence-verify` re-parses every
# archived response and byte-compares the rebuilt series, so an operator who
# does hold redistribution rights can move the bytes and a third party can
# check them.
data/v8_evidence/*/raw/
data/v8_evidence/*/series/
data/v8_evidence/*/panel.jsonl
data/v8_evidence/*/panel_manifest.json
data/v8_evidence/*/panel_manifest.sha256
data/v8_packs/
